      "translation": "Strength",
      "explanation": "Kraft most often means strength or energy. It is used for physical strength, effort and endurance. In a technical context, Kraft can mean strength or energy. In the phrase in Kraft, it means “in force”. With Fachkraft, it can mean a skilled worker or specialist.",
