      "explanation": "Main idea: tragen means to carry something, to carry something with you, or to wear clothing. With a bag or a child, it means to carry. With glasses, a watch, or clothing, it means to carry or wear. It is not the same as bringen 'bring' or anziehen 'put on'.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "de": "Kannst du die Tasche tragen?",
          "lv": "Can you carry a bag"
        },
        {
          "de": "Er trägt das Kind auf dem Arm.",
          "lv": "He carries the child in his arms."
        },
        {
          "de": "Sie trägt eine blaue Jacke.",
          "lv": "She wears a blue jacket."
        },
        {
          "de": "Ich trage eine Brille.",
          "lv": "I wear glasses"
        },
        {
          "de": "Der Tisch trägt viel Gewicht.",
          "lv": "The table can withstand a lot of weight."
        },
        {
          "de": "Was trägst du heute?",
          "lv": "What are you wearing today"
        }
      ],
      "comparison": [
        {
          "word": "tragen",
          "meaning": "Carry / carry / wear",
          "example": "Ich trage eine Tasche. = I'm carrying a bag."
        },
        {
          "word": "anziehen",
          "meaning": "Put on",
          "example": "Ich ziehe die Jacke an. = I put on my jacket."
        },
        {
          "word": "bringen",
          "meaning": "Bring / deliver",
          "example": "Ich bringe dir das Buch. = I brought you a book."
        },
        {
          "word": "halten",
          "meaning": "Hold",
          "example": "Ich halte das Kind. = I'm holding a baby."
        }
      ],
      "tip": {
        "leftBlocks": [
          {
            "text": "Clothing is often \"worn\" with tragen in German: eine Jacke tragen."
          },
          {
            "text": "Ja gribi pateikt “uzvilkt”, lieto anziehen; ja “atnest”, lieto bringen."
          }
        ]
      },
      "important": {
        "text": "Tragen is not just about hand-carrying.",
        "example": "eine Tasche tragen = nest somu. eine Jacke tragen = valkāt jaku. eine Brille tragen = nēsāt brilles. eine Jacke anziehen = uzvilkt jaku."
      },
